<title>UK: Sterling rises to 2.80 marks in Europe - dealers.</title>
<headline>Sterling rises to 2.80 marks in Europe - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pound rose to 2.80 marks in European trading for the first time since September 1992, dealers said.</p>
<p>Sterling rose above its old floor in the European exchange rate mechanism at 2.7780 marks on Monday.</p>
<p>At 1028 GMT the pound traded at 2.7994/99 marks, compared with 2.7891/02 in late European trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- London forex desk + 44 171 542 7792</p>
